compared to you or me. And this was originally an accidental discovery. We had somebody contact us a bunch of years ago now and said, I have a son who is a polyblood, learning, you know, I had like 20 or something languages. Would you be interested in testing him? And, you know, I was young. I guess I'm still pretty young, but I was younger

