in upward of 20 languages, maybe it's some combination of some innate talent, if you wish. People sometimes get upset about the use of terms like that, but, you know, whatever, innate biases to be good at language, whatever, and a lot of practice. And then maybe combine those things together. You can kind of get to the real extreme of that ability to learn so many different mappings between meanings and forms.

