between, say, musical ability and language ability? Because you would think there are some languages that are very tonal and they almost sound like music. And yet there isn't a connection. Do you have any understanding of why that might be? It just seems counterintuitive. To clarify the lack of, so the dissociation between language and music is happening at the level of kind of language understanding.

