00:17:48.000 --> 00:18:08.000
Like all these caregivers around you, they love you and they interact with you every time you're awake. Like pretty much every time you're awake, there is some kind of language. It's a very different experience from taking a class. And even in immersion, right? Like you may go to Paris. You're sitting in a cafe. Somebody will occasionally talk to you. But it's not like you're constantly having people who love you.

